    "name": "S&P Global Commodity Insights Authentication Entity Resolution API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "HTTP-based RESTful API providing access to energy and commodity market data through the S&P Global Commodity Insights (formerly Platts) platform. Covers market data, reference data, and historical prices for oil, gas, petrochemicals, power, shipping, metals, and agriculture. Supports JSON and XML response formats.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: S&P Global Developer Portal",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
